  "notes": {
    "fr": "Pattern C — priorite 80 sur 90. Main: trefle KQJ109 (atout long fort) + carreau A + pique A. 80 trefle ET 90 trefle qualifient -> la Feuille priorise 80. Reel: a ouvert 90 trefle PUIS est monte CAPOT trefle, reussi 500/0. La priorite 80 sur cette main est absurde, c'etait un capot. A trancher: exception a 80>90 sur atout long fort? Interne.",
    "en": "Pattern C — 80-over-90 priority. Hand: club KQJ109 (strong long trump) + diamond A + spade A. Both 80 and 90 clubs qualify -> sheet prioritizes 80. Real: opened 90 clubs then jumped to CAPOT clubs, made 500/0. The 80 priority here is absurd — it was a capot. To ratify: exception to 80>90 on strong long trump? Internal."
  },
